// Definitive Edition character archives. Only materials whose complete
// render-table/LOD candidate set resolves to one compact UV ellipse are kept.
// Ambiguous or unresolved materials intentionally fail closed; see the audit
// manifest in artifacts/validation/material-scattering-20260728/.
//
// UV-mask convention (with wrapped deltas):
//   delta = frac(uv - center + 0.5) - 0.5
//   normalized_radius = length(delta / float2(radius_u, radius_v))
// The conservative iris transition leaves the iris/cornea unblurred and raises
// the scattering weight toward the sclera.

